>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Site-by-site g-xTB correction of ligand connectivity. The same-ID source contains Si–F, In the supplied input F52 is 1.636 Å from Si, with g-xTB bond order 0.918 and published bond order 0.986. Restore the fifth Si–F bond, Use [SiF₅]⁻; F47 is 4.936 Å from Si, Keep it as F⁻ coordinated to Zn, Retain Zn(II). Localized 32 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

